msgstr "Understanding Period Advancement (Term/Semester/Single)"

#: schools/templates/schools/manage_term.html:55
msgid ""
"Cette fonction est essentielle pour la continuité de l'année scolaire. Elle "
"permet de faire passer manuellement les niveaux scolaires d'une période "
"(trimestre, semestre, unique) à la suivante."
msgstr ""
"This function is essential for the continuity of the school year. It allows "
"you to manually move school levels from one period (term, semester, single) "
"to the next."

