#, python-brace-format
msgid "Année Scolaire. L'étape d'enregistrement commence : {school}"
msgstr "School Year. Registration stage begins: {school}"

#: users/utils.py:501
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Cher Administrateur,\n"
"\n"
"L'étape d'enregistrement de la nouvelle année scolaire a officiellement "
"commencé pour l'école {school}.\n"
"\n"
"Vous pouvez maintenant vous connecter à la plateforme pour :\n"
"1. Valider les inscriptions des nouveaux élèves.\n"
"2. Finaliser la configuration des classes et des cours. \n"
"3. Mettre à jour les plannings.\n"
"\n"
"Veuillez procéder aux vérifications nécessaires pour assurer une transition "
"fluide.\n"
"\n"
"Cordialement,\n"
"L'Équipe de Gestion.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Dear Administrator,\n"
"\n"
"The registration stage for the new school year has officially begun for "
"{school}.\n"
"\n"
"You can now log in to the platform to:\n"
"1. Validate new student enrollments.\n"
"2. Finalize class and course setup.\n"
"3. Update schedules.\n"
"\n"
"Please perform the necessary checks to ensure a smooth transition.\n"
"\n"
"Best regards,\n"
"The Management Team.\n"
"        "

