"\n"
"Dear Staff Member (Teacher / CPE / Administrator),\n"
"\n"
"The normal operation stage of the school year is now active for {school}.\n"
"\n"
"The platform is fully operational for:\n"
"1. Entering grades and appreciations.\n"
"2. Managing absences and lateness.\n"
"3. Accessing communication tools with parents and students.\n"
"\n"
"We wish you a great year!\n"
"\n"
"Best regards,\n"
